cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Automated Test Generation with Large Language Models: A Systematic Mapping Study — Replication Package"
abstract: >-
  Replication package of a systematic mapping study on the use of Large
  Language Models (LLMs) for automated test generation. It contains the
  search results, screening steps (title/abstract, exclusion, inclusion),
  classification, codebook, and consolidated data for 618 studies selected
  from 8,895 records published between January 2021 and May 2026.
